  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Occupied Palestinian Territories Scholarship Support 2024-25</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment provides management support to the Australia Awards Scholarships program in the Occupied Palestinian Territories. Australia provides scholarships for Palestinians to study in Australian universities. Scholarships are provided at Masters&#x2019; level in the priority sectors determined each year. Australia&#x2019;s scholarships focus on building public sector management skills within the Palestinian Authority (PA) and civic institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
